@verification.api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5025

### Get all messages
GET {{verification.api_HostAddress}}/messages
Accept: application/json

### Get message by ID
GET {{verification.api_HostAddress}}/messages/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Send an SMS
POST {{verification.api_HostAddress}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "+1234567890",
  "body": "Hello from Cohabit!"
}

### Existing weather forecast endpoint
GET {{verification.api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json
